<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 167 0 R
/E (Everything started when we noticed people constantly sending messages in the university group chats, asking whoever had blocked their car to move it. Sometimes, these messages would get lost among other texts, leaving people waiting and frustrated. So we came up with the idea of safepark. By scanning a QR code on a car, anyone can quickly notify its owner about an issue with no phone calls, no searching through university group chats. All you have to do is scan the QR code and the car owner will get a notification)
/Pg 11 0 R
/K [3]
>>
endobj
