/E (StudentGro is a personalised planner designed to help university students overcome poor organisation and time management. It organises daily, weekly, and monthly schedules, allowing students to categorise their academic and personal tasks in one place. By creating organised schedules based on their tasks and available time, StudentGro helps students manage their workload more easily and balance their studies with everyday life.)
/Pg 15 0 R
/K [3]
