265 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 172 0 R
/E (StudentGro brings everything students need into one app, eliminating the need to switch between multiple applications. It includes a study timer and break timer to help students stay focused while maintaining a healthy study routine. The built-in calendar keeps their schedules organised, while AI prioritises important tasks and helps students manage their workload. Students can also set reminders for upcoming project deadlines, assignments, and quizzes. Additionally, the app includes personal reminders for students who struggle to remember to take their medication or drink enough water, along with an AI assistant \(Eagle\) to provide helpful guidance and support whenever they need it.)
/Pg 16 0 R
/K [2]
>>
