/Title (The QR code sticker on the car when scanned, the QR code opens a web page where users can upload a photo and describe the issue such as left-on headlights or a blocked car. To ensure safety and prevent abuse, users must log in with an account, and an automated content filter strictly blocks spam, and inappropriate messages, This allows drivers in lectures or meetings to receive instant, secure notifications without taking a phone call,Every 15 minutes, someone in the university group asks, 'Whose car is this?' or reports a blocked car or hazard lights left on.)
